Value Required interface (\S+)
Value transceiver_present (absent)
Value dom_supported (does not support this function)
Value temperature_celsius (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value voltage_volts (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value channel (\d+)
Value bias_current_ma (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value tx_power_dbm (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value temperature_high_alarm_celsius (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value temperature_low_alarm_celsius (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value voltage_high_alarm_volts (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value voltage_low_alarm_volts (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value bias_current_high_alarm_ma (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value bias_current_low_alarm_ma (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value rx_high_alarm_dbm (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value rx_low_alarm_dbm (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value tx_high_alarm_dbm (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value tx_low_alarm_dbm (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value rx_high_warning_dbm (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value rx_low_warning_dbm (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value tx_high_warning_dbm (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value tx_low_warning_dbm (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))
Value Required rx_power_dbm (-?(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|inf))

Start
  ^\S+ transceiver diagnostic information: -> Continue.Record
  ^${interface} transceiver diagnostic information:
  ^The transceiver (?:is ${transceiver_present}|${dom_supported})\.
  ^\s*Temp\..*Bias\(mA\) -> Single
  ^\[module\] -> Skip
  ^__NETOPS_TEXTFSM_END_OF_INPUT_7F3A9C__ -> Record

Single
  ^\s*${temperature_celsius}\s+${voltage_volts}\s+${bias_current_ma}\s+${rx_power_dbm}\s+${tx_power_dbm}\s*$$ -> Threshold

Module
  ^\s*${temperature_celsius}\s+${voltage_volts}\s*$$ -> Lanes

Lanes
  ^\s*${channel}\s+${bias_current_ma}\s+${rx_power_dbm}\s+${tx_power_dbm}\s*$$
  ^\s*Alarm thresholds: -> Threshold

Threshold
  ^\s*High\s+${temperature_high_alarm_celsius}\s+${voltage_high_alarm_volts}\s+${bias_current_high_alarm_ma}\s+${rx_high_alarm_dbm}\s+${tx_high_alarm_dbm}
  ^\s*Low\s+${temperature_low_alarm_celsius}\s+${voltage_low_alarm_volts}\s+${bias_current_low_alarm_ma}\s+${rx_low_alarm_dbm}\s+${tx_low_alarm_dbm}
  ^\s*Warning thresholds: -> Warning
  ^\S+ transceiver diagnostic information: -> Continue.Record
  ^${interface} transceiver diagnostic information: -> Start
  ^__NETOPS_TEXTFSM_END_OF_INPUT_7F3A9C__ -> Record

Warning
  ^\s*High\s+\S+\s+\S+\s+\S+\s+${rx_high_warning_dbm}\s+${tx_high_warning_dbm}
  ^\s*Low\s+\S+\s+\S+\s+\S+\s+${rx_low_warning_dbm}\s+${tx_low_warning_dbm}
  ^\S+ transceiver diagnostic information: -> Continue.Record
  ^${interface} transceiver diagnostic information: -> Start
  ^__NETOPS_TEXTFSM_END_OF_INPUT_7F3A9C__ -> Record


Skip
  ^\S+ transceiver diagnostic information: -> Continue.Clearall
  ^${interface} transceiver diagnostic information: -> Start

EOF
